# Paths Speakeasy generation must never write to or clean up.
#
# scripts/ only holds thin wrappers that delegate to the real implementations
# in ci/ (which is outside the generator's output paths entirely and therefore
# untouchable by construction). Without this file, `speakeasy run` rewrites
# scripts/publish.sh with its naive `uv build && uv publish --token` template
# and silently drops the dual attio/gtm-attio release pipeline.
#
# ci/post_generate_patch.py additionally restores the wrappers after every
# generation in case this ignore file ever stops being honored.
scripts/
